                        U TOKU
                    </span>
                </header>

                <div class="finance-trip-identity">
                    <div>
                        <span>Vozač</span>
                        <strong>Marko Petrović</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <span>Vozilo</span>
                        <strong>BG-123-AB</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <span>Polazak</span>
                        <strong>17.09.2026 · 06:30</strong>
                    </div>

